    "title": "Annual Laurel Lake Soup and Sandwich Dinner Postponed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editor@remindernewspaper.net ,\n1 days ago COMMERCIAL TWP. — The Annual Soup and Sandwich dinner hosted by the Laurel Lake Property Owners’ Association originally slated for 6 p.m. Saturday, Feb. 7 at the LLPOA Clubhouse/Community Center was postponed due to less than ideal road conditions. Keep reading the Reminder to find out the rescheduled date. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
